OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland                      
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FLargely 
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells on Sunday and    
OL,7,FMonday, overnight frost. Rain perhaps  
OL,8,Farriving from the west on Tuesday with 
OL,9,Fstrengthening winds.                   
